                    "message": "I'm not quite following these...  Should they be in their own sh script?\n\nIt looks like we're setting up two different routings on any console change?  Something about that doesn't jive with me..... was that intentional?\n\nKeep in mind, these are socket activated, so if these are intended to be set at startup and never touched, this file probably isn't where you want to do that."
